                            	  5379: _L_z07_UpdateArrowOrBoomerang_CompareLimit:
                            	  5380:     ; For boomerangs, compare it to the movement limit.
                            	  5381:     ; If it reached the limit, set state $20 and a new movement
                            	  5382:     ; limit of $10, and go handle the rest as if blocked.
                            	  5383:     ; State $20 will become $30 below in HandleArrowOrBoomerangBlocked.
                            	  5384:     ;
                            	  5385:     ; Otherwise, only animate and check collision as usual.
                            	  5386:     ;
                            	  5387:     ; In major state $30, ObjMovingLimit is a timer to change the state to $40.
                            	  5388:     ;
